Scott: GeekNights is recorded live with no studio and no audience.

538
00:42:51,772 --> 00:42:55,220
Scott: But unlike those other late shows, it's actually recorded at night.

539
00:42:55,680 --> 00:43:08,960
Rym: And the Patreon patrons for this episode of GeekNights are Alan Joyce, Lynn Kijing, Jared Lilly, Tenebrae Case, Cara Mates, Musa Christ, Chris Hadad, Chris Kork, Lynch and Walton, Finn, Joel Hays, Penny Rymer, Rebecca Dunn, Sam Erickson, Shervin Von Hurl, and a bunch of people who do not want me to say their names.

540
00:43:09,662 --> 00:43:10,164
Rym: We're back.

541
00:43:10,365 --> 00:43:14,000
Rym: We'll be doing GeekNights on our regular schedule for the foreseeable future.

542
00:43:16,102 --> 00:43:20,372
Rym: And for now, I'm hungry and I gotta edit GeekNights and maybe play some Friends vs.

543
00:43:20,392 --> 00:43:22,578
Rym: Friends, so I leave you tonight with...

544
00:43:25,502 --> 00:43:26,377
Scott: Hey, what's going on?

545
00:43:28,222 --> 00:43:31,180
Scott: Ah, those bums won their court case, so they're marching today.

546
00:43:31,481 --> 00:43:31,918
Scott: What bums?

547
00:43:32,580 --> 00:43:34,000
Scott: The fucking Nazi party.

548
00:43:36,020 --> 00:43:37,065
Scott: Illinois Nazis.

549
00:43:39,595 --> 00:43:40,920
Rym: I hate Illinois Nazis.

550
00:43:41,851 --> 00:43:42,276
Rym: I'll end up...

